vents":"write","statuses":"write","vulnerability_alerts":"read"},"events":["branch_protection_rule","check_run","check_suite","create","delete","deployment","deployment_status","discussion","discussion_comment","fork","gollum","issues","issue_comment","label","merge_group","milestone","page_build","public","pull_request","pull_request_review","pull_request_review_comment","push","registry_package","release","repository","repository_dispatch","status","watch","workflow_dispatch","workflow_run"]},"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4125415347","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/38670#issuecomment-4125415347","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/38670","id":4125415347,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY8715Nez","user":{"login":"rkarim08","id":189647147,"node_id":"U_kgDOC03JKw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/189647147?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08","html_url":"https://github.com/rkarim08","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rkarim08/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-25T10:30:37Z","updated_at":"2026-03-25T21:23:24Z","body":"@bcherny \n## Update: Root cause found + partial fix\n\n### Root Cause: `plugin.json` manifest validation\n\nThe actual reason skills weren't registering was a **manifest validation failure** on `plugin.json`. The `repository` and `bugs` fields were npm-style objects instead of plain strings:\n\n```json\n// BROKEN (object — copied from package.json format):\n\"repository\": { \"type\": \"git\", \"url\": \"https://github.com/rkarim08/sia\" }\n\"bugs\": { \"url\": \"https://github.com/rkarim08/sia/issues\" }\n\n// FIXED (string — what Claude Code expects):\n\"repository\": \"https://github.com/rkarim08/sia\"\n\"bugs\": \"https://github.com/rkarim08/sia/issues\"\n```\n\n**When manifest validation fails, the entire plugin is silently rejected** — no skills, commands, or agents register. Hooks and CLAUDE.md still load because they use different code paths.\n\nThe error message only appeared on a fresh session start:\n> `Plugin sia has an invalid manifest file at .claude-plugin/plugin.json.`\n> `Validation errors: repository: Invalid input: expected string, received object`\n\n### Fix applied\n\nAfter changing `repository` and `bugs` to strings in both source and cached `plugin.json`, running `/reload-plugins` shows:\n\n> **Reloaded: 21 plugins · 83 skills · 44 agents · 12 hooks · 5 plugin MCP servers · 1 LSP server**\n\nAll `/sia` skills and commands now register correctly.\n\n### Remaining issue: VS Code chat panel doesn't show plugin commands\n\nAfter the fix, skills register and work in the **integrated terminal** (full Claude Code CLI), but the **VS Code extension chat panel** (sidebar) still shows \"No matching commands\" when typing `/sia`. \n\nThis appears to be a VS Code extension UI limitation — the chat panel may not surface third-party plugin skills even when they're properly loaded by the CLI runtime underneath.\n\n**Screenshot evidence:** Terminal shows `/sia` with all commands listed. VS Code chat sidebar shows \"No matching commands\" for the same `/sia` query, same session.\n\n<img width=\"1006\" height=\"718\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/243b05ee-a1a9-427d-b850-9002879a2ebe\" />\n\n### Suggestions\n\n1. **Improve validation error visibility** — the manifest validation error only shows briefly on startup and is easy to miss. Consider surfacing it more prominently (e.g., in `/plugin` output or the Manage Plugins UI).\n2. **Document `plugin.json` schema** — the expected types for fields like `repository` (string, not object) aren't documented, and the npm `package.json` object format is a natural mistake.\n3. **VS Code chat panel** should surface plugin skills the same way the terminal CLI does.\n\n### Environment (updated)\n\n- Claude Code version: 2.1.83\n- VS Code extension + integrated terminal\n- macOS Darwin 24.3.0","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4125415347/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/comments/4316747751","html_url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/issues/38670#issuecomment-4316747751","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/anthropics/claude-code/issues/38670","id":4316747751,"node_id":"IC_kwDON91aY88AAAABAUxX5w","user":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_ur